    <div class="content-split__image content-split__image--top">
      <img src="/assets/images/give/bob-jean-benedict-founding-challengers.webp" alt="Bob and Jean Benedict, founding Tin Cup Challengers, smiling at a Community Foundation event" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="content-split__content content-split__content--light-bg">
      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">The Process</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Tin Cup Challenge is designed to maximize collaborative community impact. The annual campaign strengthens the tremendous work of Teton Valley's nonprofits, encourages everyone to give, and fosters the spirit of generosity.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Challengers pledge a matching gift during the Giving Period</li>
        <li>Community members donate to participating nonprofits</li>
        <li>Challenger funds match donations to amplify every gift</li>
        <li>Challengers support Tin Cup Challenge Event Day — always the 3rd Saturday in July</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="content-split__buttons">
        <a href="https://tincupchallenge.org/nonprofits/challenger-fund" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="theme_btn theme_btn_bg">Become a Challenger <span aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

