      <p class="content-split__text">One of the most innovative charitable fundraisers in the nation, the <a href="https://tincupchallenge.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">Tin Cup Challenge</a> is also one of the most successful. Since 2008, this event has raised over $30.8 million, directly benefiting Teton Valley's nonprofits working tirelessly to enhance our quality of life.</p>
